  "body": "Looking for your first home or ready to downsize without giving up the things you love? This could be the perfect fit! Our vendors have simply outgrown their much-loved home and are ready to upsize, creating a fantastic opportunity for the next lucky owners.\r\n\r\nBeautifully refreshed and full of character, this inviting home offers easy, comfortable living with much of the hard work already done. The roof was replaced in 2023, with updated kitchens and bathrooms and gorgeous whitewashed ceilings adding a fresh, relaxed coastal feel.\r\n\r\nEnjoy easy indoor-outdoor flow to a fully fenced outdoor area, perfect for children, entertaining or simply relaxing in the sunshine. And there's a bonus - room to park the boat or campervan! Ideal for those wanting to enjoy the coastal lifestyle without sacrificing space for their toys.\r\n\r\nPositioned in popular Red Beach, close to beaches, schools, shops and local amenities, this is a home that offers comfort, convenience and lifestyle.   Whether you're starting out or slowing down, this could be the move you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nMotivated vendors are ready for their next chapter - come and see what this home has to offer!\r\n\r\nTo download/view the property files please copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/FGSB",
